%% DESIGN_PROPOSAL / NOT_LIVE. Symbolic messages; no customer or provider event executed.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Source as Website form / native lead or message
  participant In as L1/L2 Receiver
  participant Scope as Backend identity + integration binding
  participant DB as Primary inbox / domain transaction
  participant CRM as CRM façade + intake worker
  participant Notify as Notification adapter
  participant Owner as Human Sales owner
  participant M as Marketing / L8 projection
  Note over Source,M: DESIGN_PROPOSAL / NOT_LIVE. Contract C-INGEST + C-HANDOFF; source evidence is not qualification.
  Source->>In: Source event + source_event_id/type/time + original source trail
  In->>Scope: Verify signature/token, source account and active binding
  Scope-->>In: Server-resolved tenant/company/integration and binding revision
  alt Source invalid or binding outside scope
    In-->>Source: 401/403; no ACK / no business write
  else Verified source
    In->>DB: Atomic insert inbox + unique composite key + canonical payload hash
    Note right of DB: tenant + company + integration + source_event_id + event_type
    alt Same key and same hash
      DB-->>In: Existing intake_id and receipt
      In-->>Source: Same protocol result; no duplicate Need
    else Same key but different hash
      DB-->>In: SOURCE_EVENT_CONFLICT + quarantine evidence
      In-->>Source: 409; do not retry with a new event key
    else Persistence unavailable
      DB-->>In: No committed inbox
      In-->>Source: Retryable error; never ACK lost event
    else Durable commit confirmed
      DB-->>In: intake_id / state RECEIVED / receipt_ref
      In-->>Source: Native ACK or 202 after commit
      Note over Source,In: ACK does not prove Lead created. No LLM call or manual approval in intake path.
      CRM->>DB: Claim persisted item with lease/fence
      CRM->>Scope: Recheck company binding and writer authority
      CRM->>DB: Scoped Party lookup + legitimate Need policy + attribution evidence
      Note right of CRM: Phone is not event dedup. Existing external lookup needs scoped façade before reuse.
      alt Missing active eligible owner
        CRM->>DB: Save Need WAITING_OWNER + accountable fallback and SLA
        CRM->>M: need.created + coverage + owner exception
      else Eligible owner found by versioned assignment rule
        CRM->>DB: Atomic Need/handoff assignment + notification outbox
        CRM->>Notify: Deliver by stable notification key
        Notify-->>CRM: Provider delivery receipt or UNKNOWN
        CRM->>DB: delivered_at only with delivery evidence
        Owner->>CRM: Authenticated handoff ACK accepted/rejected + evidence
        CRM->>Scope: Verify actual assignee or explicit delegated ACK permission
        CRM->>DB: accepted_at / outcome; no fabricated first_response
        Owner->>CRM: Actual outbound evidence with source/time/recipient
        CRM->>DB: first_response_at after consent/scope/evidence checks
        CRM->>M: handoff assigned/delivered/accepted/first_response events
      end
      CRM->>M: Qualification / quote / order results via owner events
    end
  end
  Note over In,M: Organic source needs retained eligible trail through internal pages/form; missing proof remains UNKNOWN.
  Note over CRM,M: CONTACT and AD_MEASUREMENT rights separate. TEST excluded from live KPI. AI down does not stop valid intake.
